## MapConfig (ScriptableObject)

Mỗi map = 1 asset. Thêm map mới không cần code.

```csharp
[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = "NeverGiveUp/MapConfig")]
public class MapConfig : ScriptableObject
{
    public string mapId;          // "farm", "town", "forest"
    public string sceneName;      // tên scene Unity (phải khớp Build Settings)
    public EntryPoint[] entryPoints;
}

[Serializable]
public struct EntryPoint
{
    public string entryId;        // "from_town", "from_farm", "from_forest"
    public Vector3 position;
    public float rotationY;
}
```

Tìm EntryPoint:
```csharp
bool TryGetEntry(MapConfig map, string entryId, out EntryPoint result)
{
    foreach (var e in map.entryPoints)
    {
        if (e.entryId == entryId) { result = e; return true; }
    }
    result = default;
    return false;
}
```

