## Messages

```csharp
public struct OnMapTransitionStarted { }

public struct OnMapLoaded
{
    public bool useEntryPoint;
    // useEntryPoint = true  → SceneCtrl dùng entryId để đặt player
    // useEntryPoint = false → SceneCtrl dùng savedPosition
    public string entryId;
    public Vector3 savedPosition;
    public float savedRotationY;
}
```

